    "title": "ComicVid",
    "description": "ComicVid is the app for all your comic needs. It contains a wide range of comic genres and even has comic videos for users to watch, just like a mini movie. Have a story to tell? ComicVid also aims to help both aspiring and experienced creators get their comics published. Share your stories now!Description of App: ComicVid aims to provide comic enthusiasts with a different experience by not only giving them comic books to read but also giving them the chance to watch their favorite comics come alive with highly entertaining comic videos. Furthermore, ComicVid aims to help aspriring creators get their comics published, build their audience and connect with millions around the world",
